		<a name="msg9931"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=402" title="View the profile of Callon">Callon</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Drolvarg Guardian<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 320<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/opus.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								Warpig<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=402"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:murgen21@yahoo.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=840.msg9931#msg9931"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=840.msg9931#msg9931">Re: Rant re Ialin on Hegemony Raid</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #53 on:</b> August 10, 2004, 05:07:13 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Grummus is frequently up.&nbsp; Heg could have had some courtesy and held off, coming back for a quick run another time or seeing if their undoubtedly small number of people who needed it could simply tag.&nbsp; They chose to take what they could get instead, hence the complaints.&nbsp; No, they didn&#039;t break any &quot;rules&quot;.&nbsp; But they sure as hell didn&#039;t show any courtesy either.&nbsp; <br /><br />BM chose not to contest it.&nbsp; TA/JH could have taken it as well as a few of our people were requesting the flag and we were finished with our last raid.&nbsp; Our groups were already formed and we were scouting for another target, but on learning the situation asked that anyone from our guilds who needed Grummus go speak to GC/MA/SoK&nbsp; about tagging.&nbsp; Those 3 guilds had clearly been planning Grummus for awhile and we figured they deserved a shot at it.&nbsp; *shrug*&nbsp; <br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">First to engage wins the prize. Thanks for flagging my fiancee Hege.</div><br />Now you&#039;re just trying to be an asshat.<br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
